<section class="rm-head"><p class="eyebrow">Exact prices before commitment</p><h1>Review <%= customer?.name||'customer' %>’s <%= nextStep==='draft'?'draft ':'' %>order</h1><p>Check the final amounts after customer rates, quantity tiers and eligible offers. <%= nextStep==='draft'?'Approval saves a draft without reserving stock.':nextStep==='confirm'?'Approval saves the order and reserves available stock; shortages remain backordered.':'Approval confirms your statement that this pickup customer has the goods, releases the exact units and posts the invoice.' %> No payment or email is recorded.</p></section>
<section class="card"><div class="table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Units</th><th>Price each</th><th>Discount</th><th>Tax</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const line of quote.lines){const product=products.find(p=>p.id===line.skuId); %><tr><th scope="row"><%= product?.display_name||product?.code||'Product' %></th><td><%= line.quantity %></td><td><%= helpers.money(line.unitPriceMinor,quote.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(line.discountMinor,quote.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(line.taxMinor,quote.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(line.totalMinor,quote.currency) %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><div class="card-body"><% for(const applied of quote.applied){ %><p><%= applied.name %>: −<%= helpers.money(applied.amountMinor,quote.currency) %></p><% } %><% if(quote.unusedCodes.length){ %><p class="notice notice--warn">Not applied: <%= quote.unusedCodes.join(', ') %>. These codes may be ineligible, expired, excluded or fully used.</p><% } %><p><strong>Total <%= helpers.money(quote.totalMinor,quote.currency) %></strong></p>
<% if(quote.violations.length){ %><div class="notice notice--warn"><h2>A pricing safeguard needs attention</h2><ul><% for(const v of quote.violations){ %><li><%= v.kind.replaceAll('_',' ') %></li><% } %></ul><p>No order can be saved at these prices. Review the underlying prices or the authorized safeguard.</p></div><% }else{ %><form method="post" action="/sales/pricing/order-reviews/<%= reviewId %>/approve"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn btn--primary"><%= nextStep==='draft'?'Approve pricing and save draft':nextStep==='confirm'?'Approve pricing and reserve stock':'Confirm collected goods and post invoice' %></button></form><% } %><a href="/orders/new">Return to order entry</a></div></section>
